---
title: "oauth_client_create (stem-system: Admin OAuth Client Creation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_auth --> q_no_auth: no user
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: user present
    q_no_auth --> [*]: return 401 Unauthorized
    q_check_admin --> q_query_admin: select is_admin from members
    q_query_admin --> q_not_admin: not admin
    q_query_admin --> q_validate_body: is admin
    q_not_admin --> [*]: return 403 Forbidden
    q_validate_body --> q_parse: parse JSON body (name, redirect_uris)
    q_parse --> q_invalid: missing name or redirect_uris
    q_parse --> q_generate: valid
    q_invalid --> [*]: return 400 invalid request
    q_generate --> q_gen_id: clientId = generateRandomString(32)
    q_gen_id --> q_gen_secret: clientSecret = generateRandomString(48)
    q_gen_secret --> q_hash: clientSecretHash = bcrypt.hash(secret, 10)
    q_hash --> q_save: rpc create_application(name, client_id, hash, redirect_uris, created_by)
    q_save --> q_save_err: error
    q_save --> q_return: success
    q_save_err --> [*]: return 500 failed to create
    q_return --> [*]: return application + client_secret (plaintext, shown once only)

    note right of q_gen_secret
        INV-001: client_id = 64 hex chars (32 random bytes)
        INV-002: client_secret = 96 hex chars (48 random bytes)
        INV-003: only the bcrypt hash of client_secret is stored
        INV-004: plaintext client_secret is returned only at creation time
    end note
